          "id": "resp-17ynpk",
          "statement": "Resolves identifier, import, and qualified-path references into symbol- and file-level dependency edges, binding a bare identifier only through the file's own declared imports in languages that have them, and deliberately under-reporting ambiguous references rather than guessing.",
          "lastTouchedAt": 1789202772
