        },
        {
          "id": "resp-11s4zn",
          "statement": "**When** a C# file names a type, **bind** it only to a top-level type declared in the file's own namespace, an enclosing namespace, or a namespace its `using` directives import.",
          "lastTouchedAt": 1790185503
        },
        {
          "id": "resp-nzbv27",
          "statement": "**When** an edge rests on bare-name coincidence alone, **mark** it as guessed.",
