          "id": "resp-bn84aw",
          "statement": "**When** choosing which claims to probe, **ranks** re-checks of a survivor whose test has changed first, then never-probed claims, then claims changed since their probe, spreading across test files and starting with the tests that back the most claims",
          "lastTouchedAt": 1790943051
