          "statement": "Parses JUnit XML test reports from any runner (vitest, pytest, nextest, …) into flat test cases.",
          "lastTouchedAt": 1788959020
        },
        {
          "id": "resp-jrtmbb",
          "statement": "Matches reported cases against the model's attached-test map by normalized name (with a file-stem tiebreak), aggregating to a worst-outcome verdict per claim, and surfaces unseen attachments and unbreakable ties rather than guessing.",
          "lastTouchedAt": 1788959020
